@add_wissell
title: Rudolf Wissell
subtitle: <span style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px;"><img src="img/portraits/WissellRudolf.jpg" style="width: 25%; height: auto; object-fit: cover; border: 5px solid #000000ff; flex-shrink: 0;"><span>Wissell is a labor economist working for the ADGB, the federation of free trade unions, and has been a labor minister on multiple occasions. His priority is to improve conditions for organized workers.</span></span>{!<br><br>!}[? if difficulty < 0 : Actions - Union-Party Coordination, Labor Rights ?]
tags: labor_advisor
view-if: wissell_advisor = 0 and labor_advisors < labor_slots and unions_independent = 0
on-arrival: wissell_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1; labor_advisors += 1
go-to: advisor_menu

Rudolf Wissell is now an advisor.

@add_woytinsky
title: Wladimir Woytinsky
subtitle: <span style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px;"><img src="img/portraits/WoytinskyWladimir.jpg" style="width: 25%; height: auto; object-fit: cover; border: 5px solid #000000ff; flex-shrink: 0;"><span>Wladimir Woytinsky is a Russian Menshevik in exile, and the chief economist of the socialist trade union federation. His primary idea is to use massive government spending as a way of stimulating demand to extricate us from the depression.</span></span>{!<br><br>!}[? if difficulty < 0 : Actions - Emergency Deficit Budget, Addressing the Economic Crisis, Carrying Out the Economic Plan ?]
tags: labor_advisor
view-if: woytinsky_advisor = 0 and labor_advisors < labor_slots and unions_independent = 0
on-arrival: woytinsky_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1; labor_advisors += 1
go-to: advisor_menu

Wladimir Woytinsky is now an advisor.

################### neorevisionists

@add_mierendorff
title: Carlo Mierendorff
subtitle: <span style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px;"><img src="img/portraits/MierendorffCarlo.jpg" style="width: 25%; height: auto; object-fit: cover; border: 5px solid #000000ff; flex-shrink: 0;"><span>Carlo Mierendorff is the founder of the neo-revisionist ideological tendency, and supports both democratic reforms and extra-parliamentary action to combat the Nazis and authoritarian parties. He is from a middle-class, academic background, and is one of our youngest leaders.</span></span>{!<br><br>!}[? if difficulty < 0 : Actions - Build the Iron Front, Warning About the Nazis ?]
tags: neorev_advisor
view-if: mierendorff_advisor = 0 and neorevisionism > 0 and neo_advisors < neo_slots and neorev_split = 0
on-arrival: mierendorff_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1; neo_advisors += 1
go-to: advisor_menu

Carlo Mierendorff is now an advisor.

@add_schumacher
title: Kurt Schumacher
subtitle: <span style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px;"><img src="img/portraits/SchumacherKurt.jpg" style="width: 25%; height: auto; object-fit: cover; border: 5px solid #000000ff; flex-shrink: 0;"><span>A Great War veteran and a neorevisionist leader, Kurt Schumacher argues for a strong resistance against the Nazis.</span></span>{!<br><br>!}[? if difficulty < 0 : Actions - Emergency Fundraising, Building the Reichsbanner, Addressing the Economic Crisis ?]
tags: neorev_advisor
view-if: schumacher_advisor = 0 and neorevisionism > 0 and neo_advisors < neo_slots
on-arrival: schumacher_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1; neo_advisors += 1
go-to: advisor_menu

Kurt Schumacher is now an advisor.

@add_leber
title: Julius Leber
subtitle: <span style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px;"><img src="img/portraits/LeberJulius.jpg" style="width: 25%; height: auto; object-fit: cover; border: 5px solid #000000ff; flex-shrink: 0;"><span>Leber is a former army officer who turned against the military leaders of the Kapp Putsch in 1920, helping us put down the army's attempted coup. He is in favor of expanded democracy and building a broad popular base for the SPD.</span></span>{!<br><br>!}[? if difficulty < 0 : Actions - Rally for Democracy, Military Affairs, Building a People's Party ?]
tags: neorev_advisor
view-if: leber_advisor = 0 and neorevisionism > 0 and neo_advisors < neo_slots
on-arrival: leber_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1; neo_advisors += 1
go-to: advisor_menu

Julius Leber is now an advisor.

################### independent (4th slot, always player-selected)

@add_baade
title: Fritz Baade
subtitle: <span style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px;"><img src="img/portraits/BaadeFritz.jpg" style="width: 25%; height: auto; object-fit: cover; border: 5px solid #000000ff; flex-shrink: 0;"><span>Baade is one of the few agricultural experts in the SPD, and an unorthodox economist.</span></span>{!<br><br>!}[? if difficulty < 0 : Actions - Agricultural Policy, Rural Campaigning, Addressing the Economic Crisis ?]
tags: nonfactional_advisor
view-if: baade_advisor = 0 and n_nonfactional_advisors < 1
on-arrival: baade_advisor = 1; n_nonfactional_advisors += 1
go-to: advisor_menu

Fritz Baade is now an advisor.

