@add_stampfer
title: Friedrich Stampfer
subtitle: <span style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px;"><img src="img/portraits/StampferFriedrich.jpg" style="width: 25%; height: auto; object-fit: cover; border: 5px solid #000000ff; flex-shrink: 0;"><span>Friedrich Stampfer is the long-time editor-in-chief of Vorwärts, our party newspaper, and also a Reichstag member. He was historically part of the Majority SPD that supported our participation in the Great War, but also supports cooperation with the KPD to save the Republic.</span></span>{!<br><br>!}[? if difficulty < 0 : Actions - Media, Editorial Line, Cooperation with the KPD ?]
tags: nonfactional_advisor
view-if: stampfer_advisor = 0 and n_nonfactional_advisors < 1
on-arrival: stampfer_advisor = 1; n_nonfactional_advisors += 1
go-to: advisor_menu

